Wow, I never thought I'd ascend that fast again.

Anyway, I started playing monks and wizards for fun after my YAFAP at 
the end of January. Noone really survived long. Then I accidentally hit 
'y' at the question if the RNG should choose a character for me. Oh 
well, might as well play that rogue.

